# PRD: MyApp

**Branch**: `ralph/feature-name`

## Description
Brief description of the feature being built

## Stories

### [ ] US-001: Add database schema for tasks (P1)
As a developer, I want a tasks table in the database so that task data can be persisted

**Acceptance Criteria**
- [ ] Tasks table created with columns: id, title, description, status, priority, created_at, updated_at
- [ ] Database migration runs successfully
- [ ] Typecheck passes
- [ ] Tests pass

**Notes**

---

### [ ] US-002: Create task CRUD API endpoints (P2)
As a developer, I want REST API endpoints for creating, reading, updating, and deleting tasks

**Acceptance Criteria**
- [ ] GET /api/tasks returns list of tasks
- [ ] POST /api/tasks creates a new task
- [ ] PUT /api/tasks/:id updates an existing task
- [ ] DELETE /api/tasks/:id deletes a task
- [ ] Input validation on create and update
- [ ] Typecheck passes
- [ ] Tests pass

**Notes**

---

### [ ] US-003: Build task list UI component (P3)
As a user, I want to see a list of my tasks so that I can track what needs to be done

**Acceptance Criteria**
- [ ] Task list component displays tasks from API
- [ ] Each task shows title, status, and priority
- [ ] Empty state shown when no tasks exist
- [ ] Loading state shown while fetching
- [ ] Typecheck passes
- [ ] Tests pass

**Notes**

---
